<title>BELGIUM: SNCI RAISES INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>SNCI RAISES INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian industrial credit bank</p>
<p>NMKN/SNCI said on Wednesday it was raising the maximum rates for</p>
<p>its investment credits with immediate effect Wednesday,</p>
<p>following a rise in long-term interest rates and a similar move</p>
<p>announced by Belgium's main banks.</p>
<p>    Maturity		   New rate     Old rate</p>
<p>    three-year revisable   5.70 pct     5.55 pct</p>
<p>    five-year revisable    6.60 pct     6.40 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
